WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.100
Who's involved?

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:06.234
Platform engineers who run Ansible beside
Arc, the developers who keep the inventory

3
00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:10.862
and playbooks, and the reviewers who read
the plan before and the result after.

4
00:00:10.862 --> 00:00:13.836
The onboarding identity
gets one narrow role:

5
00:00:13.836 --> 00:00:17.513
it can read and create Arc
servers, but it can't delete them.

6
00:00:17.513 --> 00:00:21.091
There's a wrinkle: one Learn page
says it can't manage extensions,

7
00:00:21.091 --> 00:00:25.082
another lists an add-extensions
permission in it, so the chapter takes

8
00:00:25.082 --> 00:00:29.074
the stricter reading and removes
the assignment when the wave closes.

9
00:00:29.074 --> 00:00:31.940
Disconnecting needs a
different, stronger role.
